cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RealScale-Pro: Private, Offline AI Image Upscaler for Android"
message: "If you use or reference RealScale-Pro in software, benchmarks, or writing, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Rohit"
    alias: "Rohitjjn"
    email: "userrohitai@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rohitjjn/RealScale-Pro"
url: "https://rohitjjn.github.io/RealScale-Pro/"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/Rohitjjn/RealScale-Pro/releases/latest"
abstract: >-
  RealScale-Pro is a free, open-source Android application (com.realscale.pro) for offline,
  on-device image super-resolution and denoising. Built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose,
  it pairs a hardware-aware pipeline planner and SHA-256 verified on-demand model manager
  with native Vulkan ncnn and Alibaba MNN inference engines (Real-ESRGAN, RealSR, Waifu2x,
  SRMD, and Anime4K) in a 20.5 MB APK with zero cloud uploads or telemetry.
keywords:
